  "body": "Permanent. Group limit 1 in play. Purchase only at deck creation.\nWhen an investigator is dealt damage or horror, all of that damage or horror must be assigned to a single card.\nIf the chosen card does not have a printed health or sanity value  (<i>e.g. Leather Coat or Cherished Keepsake</i>), then any portion of the damage or horror that cannot be assigned to the initially chosen card must be assigned to another card. Otherwise, any excess damage or horror is not assigned elsewhere and is instead lost.",
